7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I’m Ryuji. I’ll observe the dynamics before committing to any theories. Let’s keep the discussion focused and logical.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, young ones. I am Servas. Let us listen with open hearts and minds, seeking wisdom in every word spoken.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I’m Yumi. I’m so happy to be here! Let’s all work together and have a wonderful time!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I love the energy here! @Shion, your comment was a bit intense, but I’m sure you’re just being playful. Let’s keep it friendly!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"I’m not playing. I’m analyzing. Your eagerness is suspicious, Kenji.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Shion, your hostility is noted. Kenji, your friendliness is also noted. Let us focus on logic, not personalities.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom lies in patience, not suspicion. Let us observe the flow of truth before casting judgment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"I think we should all be kind! @Shion, let's not be so harsh. We're all friends here, right?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, I’m just being friendly! I don’t want anyone to feel attacked. Let’s focus on finding the truth together, okay?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Kenji, your naivety is almost impressive. But I’ll let it slide. @Ryuji, your silence is just as telling as my words.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
